note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note aienux/crates/aienos-explain/explain.om: Pure-Omega AIENOS Explanation Bridge.
note Contract validation, bounded causal backtracking, cycle cutting, Kahn linearization,
note canonical SHA-256 bundle digests, Cortex/branch adapters, deterministic rendering,
note and clarification sessions.
note Ported from aienux crates/aienos-explain/src/{contract,bundle,build,adapters,render,session,main,lib}.rs.
note Compose with: si/directives/om2.om om/tls/sha2.om aienux/crates/aienos-explain/explain.om ...

